From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yevhen Salitrynskyi <ysalitrynskyi@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 22:15:00 -0400
Subject: ui: the 2026 desktop refresh stays on with the testing config off

Every Stedding build so far ran Chromium's field-trial testing config
(testing/variations/fieldtrial_testing_config.json): official builds do
too unless disable_fieldtrial_testing_config is set, and none of ours set
it (privacy Q10, tooling/args). Its "GlowUp" study switched on the seven
features of Chromium's 2026 desktop refresh -- MenuSimplification,
RoundedIcons, TabGroupColorRefresh, TabStripDeclutter, ToolbarGlowUp,
UpdateTabGroupColors, WebuiRefresh2026 -- and every round of the series
was built and measured against that look. With the config off the source
defaults come back: the address chip drew Chromium's old logo where the
mark had been, the first build without it showed (2026-09-09).

The seven are FEATURE_ENABLED_BY_DEFAULT here, each with the same note,
so the decision is in the source rather than in a Google experiment file.
BACKLOG S-57 is the review of each on its merits.

Why: docs/features/privacy.md Q10.
Removable when: upstream ships the refresh by default, or Stedding decides
against a feature in S-57.
---
diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/ui_features.cc b/chrome/browser/ui/ui_features.cc
index 6b2e98a16c..356f21d276 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/ui/ui_features.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/ui_features.cc
@@ -50,8 +50,16 @@ BASE_FEATURE(kImportExportFlags, base::FEATURE_DISABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
 
 BASE_FEATURE(kInfoBarInlineLinks, base::FEATURE_DISABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
 
-BASE_FEATURE(kTabStripDeclutter, base::FEATURE_DISABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
-BASE_FEATURE(kToolbarGlowUp, base::FEATURE_DISABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
+// Stedding (privacy Q10): on by default. Chromium's field-trial testing config
+// switched this on in every build until 2026-09-09, so the look and the rounds
+// were measured with it; the config is off in every Stedding build now, and the
+// decision is made here instead (patch 0042, BACKLOG S-57 for a review of each).
+BASE_FEATURE(kTabStripDeclutter, base::FEATURE_ENABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
+// Stedding (privacy Q10): on by default. Chromium's field-trial testing config
+// switched this on in every build until 2026-09-09, so the look and the rounds
+// were measured with it; the config is off in every Stedding build now, and the
+// decision is made here instead (patch 0042, BACKLOG S-57 for a review of each).
+BASE_FEATURE(kToolbarGlowUp, base::FEATURE_ENABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
 BASE_FEATURE_PARAM(bool,
                    kToolbarGlowUpReloadEnabled,
                    &kToolbarGlowUp,
@@ -62,9 +70,21 @@ BASE_FEATURE_PARAM(bool,
                    &kToolbarGlowUp,
                    "back-forward",
                    true);
-BASE_FEATURE(kMenuSimplification, base::FEATURE_DISABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
-BASE_FEATURE(kTabGroupColorRefresh, base::FEATURE_DISABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
-BASE_FEATURE(kWebuiRefresh2026, base::FEATURE_DISABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
+// Stedding (privacy Q10): on by default. Chromium's field-trial testing config
+// switched this on in every build until 2026-09-09, so the look and the rounds
+// were measured with it; the config is off in every Stedding build now, and the
+// decision is made here instead (patch 0042, BACKLOG S-57 for a review of each).
+BASE_FEATURE(kMenuSimplification, base::FEATURE_ENABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
+// Stedding (privacy Q10): on by default. Chromium's field-trial testing config
+// switched this on in every build until 2026-09-09, so the look and the rounds
+// were measured with it; the config is off in every Stedding build now, and the
+// decision is made here instead (patch 0042, BACKLOG S-57 for a review of each).
+BASE_FEATURE(kTabGroupColorRefresh, base::FEATURE_ENABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
+// Stedding (privacy Q10): on by default. Chromium's field-trial testing config
+// switched this on in every build until 2026-09-09, so the look and the rounds
+// were measured with it; the config is off in every Stedding build now, and the
+// decision is made here instead (patch 0042, BACKLOG S-57 for a review of each).
+BASE_FEATURE(kWebuiRefresh2026, base::FEATURE_ENABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
 BASE_FEATURE(kAppMenuGlowUp, base::FEATURE_DISABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
 // Enables the redesigned Settings 2026 refresh features and search UX.
 BASE_FEATURE(kSettingsRefresh2026, base::FEATURE_DISABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
